-- Cut-short routes fixed. 128 routes from the earlier OSM import (route_quality
-- 'corridor-truncated') covered only about a quarter of their road. Each is
-- re-snapped between the project's own start and end pins with the app's
-- snapToRoad (refused if it strays or is over twice the declared length), and
-- replaced only when the new line is closer to the declared length.
-- Generated 2026-10-27: 124 improved, 12 kept as they are.
-- The old routes are copied to project_routes_backup_truncated first (undo at
-- the bottom). Run once in the Supabase SQL editor. Safe to run again.
-- =============================================================================
begin;

